spaCy
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
crates/pyroid-core/src/filters/tokenizer.rs, regex.rs and tables.rs port the
English tokenizer and sentencizer of spaCy 3.8.18, https://github.com/explosion/spaCy.
tables.rs holds spaCy's tokenizer rules (prefix, suffix, infix and URL
patterns, tokenizer exceptions, sentencizer punctuation), extracted from spaCy
by generate_tables.py. spaCy's URL pattern credits https://mathiasbynens.be/demo/url-regex
and https://gist.github.com/dperini/729294 (Diego Perini, MIT License).

